WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Differential. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Predict wheel speed in a turn

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: In an open differential, the carrier drives both axle gears while allowing left and right wheel speeds to differ.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: Illustrative 27 rpm and 33 rpm wheel speeds average 30 rpm at the carrier in the ideal model.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Interactive motion prediction

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: Ideal mechanism only; friction, heat and part-specific behavior need measurements.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Predict wheel speed in a turn
